  "sourceTitle": "Gemma 4 26B-A4B and a 37 GB Qwen3.6 MoE running in a browser tab on a 24 GB Mac — experts streamed from disk, output…",
  "sourceBodyHash": "74e89ebaf86164265bee82dc14948705db6dcf8635d15bfab81836de46215b5f",
